### Layers previously recorded here that are NOT used

Three entries were carried in `docs/THIRD_PARTY_TERMS.md` and are not part of this build:
**RecipeDB NER** (no folder, no tagger, nothing reads it), **IFCT 2017** (no IFCT data is
read; "IFCT" names only the 42-nutrient schema) and **INDB** (those spreadsheets carry
`primarysource: usda` and `ukfct`). The nutrition layer is **7,847 USDA + 144 UK CoFID**
and contains no Indian composition data.

